OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'devastated' as missing
OL,4,Agirl case stays closed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a British girl who
OL,7,Fdisappeared in Australia more than 55
OL,8,Fyears ago say they are "devastated and
OL,9,Fangry" at the decision not to reopen
OL,10,Fthe case.
OL,12,FBristol toddler Cheryl Grimmer went
OL,13,Fmissing in 1970 on a beach near Sydney
OL,14,Fjust after her family had emigrated
OL,15,Fthere.
OL,17,FA man in his sixties was charged with
OL,18,Fher abduction and murder in 2017, but
OL,19,Fhis trial collapsed after his teenage
OL,20,Fconfession was ruled inadmissible.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
