OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'devastated' as missing
OL,4,Agirl case stays closed
OL,5,
OL,6,FSally Dowling, the director of public
OL,7,Fprosecutions (DPP) in New South Wales,
OL,8,Fhas now decided this decision still
OL,9,Fstands, despite years of campaigning by
OL,10,FCheryl's family to get the case
OL,11,Fre-examined.
